{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"length","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"We need count assignments to 12 variables satisfying CNF. Let's solve. Variables 1..12.\n\nClauses:\n1. (-11 OR 1)\n2. (-6 OR 8)\n3. (-5 OR 7)\n4. (9 OR 11)\n5. (-9 OR 1)\n6. (4 OR 3)\n7. (12 OR 5)\n8. (-2 OR 8)\n9. (-12 OR 7)\n10. (6 OR 2)\n11. (-4 OR 10)\n12. (-3 OR 10)\n\nWe can attempt to count via reasoning. Let's denote variables.\n\nWe can try to find constraints.\n\nClause1: 1 or not11. So if 11=1 then 1 must be 1. If 11=0 then clause satisfied regardless of 1.\n\nClause5: 1 or not9. So if 9=1 then 1 must be 1. If 9=0 then satisfied.\n\nThus 1 must be 1 if either 11=1 or 9=1. If both 9=0 and 11=0, 1 can be 0 or 1.\n\nClause2: 8 or not6. So if 6=1 then 8 must be 1. If 6=0 then satisfied.\n\nClause8: 8 or not2. So if 2=1 then 8 must be 1. If 2=0 then satisfied.\n\nClause10: 6 or 2. So at least one of 6 or 2 is 1.\n\nThus combine: if 6=1 then 8=1. if 2=1 then 8=1. Also at least one of 6,2 is 1. So 8 must be 1 if either 6 or 2 is 1. But if both 6=0 and 2=0 impossible because clause10 would fail. So at least one is 1, thus 8 must be 1. Therefore 8=1 always. Good.\n\nGiven 8=1, clauses 2 and 8 satisfied regardless of 6,2. So 6 and 2 free except clause10 requiring at least one 1.\n\nClause3: 7 or not5. So if 5=1 then 7 must be 1. If 5=0 then satisfied.\n\nClause9: 7 or not12. So if 12=1 then 7 must be 1. If 12=0 then satisfied.\n\nClause7: 12 or 5. So at least one of 12 or 5 is 1.\n\nThus we have: 12 or 5 must be 1. If 5=1 then 7 must be 1. If 12=1 then 7 must be 1. So 7 must be 1 if either 5=1 or 12=1. But at least one of 5,12 is 1, so 7 must be 1 always. Therefore 7=1.\n\nGiven 7=1, clause3 satisfied regardless of 5. Clause9 satisfied regardless of 12. So 5 and 12 free except clause7 requiring at least one 1.\n\nClause4: 9 or 11. So at least one of 9,11 is 1.\n\nClause6: 4 or 3. So at least one of 4,3 is 1.\n\nClause11: not4 or 10. So if 4=1 then 10 must be 1. If 4=0 then satisfied.\n\nClause12: not3 or 10. So"}}],"created":1790961487,"model":"C:\\Users\\d2j3\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-09-10\\napraw\\outputs\\moon-native\\models\\gpt-oss-20b-MXFP4.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10809-5266f24da","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":768,"prompt_tokens":4195,"total_tokens":4963,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-3TyPmHywFrdFFzlxSJeGRsb86UOOZ1Xc","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":4195,"prompt_ms":508.465,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.12120738974970202,"prompt_per_second":8250.3220477319,"predicted_n":768,"predicted_ms":2307.817,"predicted_per_token_ms":3.0088878748370274,"predicted_per_second":332.34870875810344}}